ust comply with all manufacturer specifications; provided, that any portion of a tower above the point at which it is anchored does not exceed the distance to the nearest adjacent property line. All mounting and electrical specifications must be provided to the Development Services Division at the time of application for a building permit to install or erect a wind energy system.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"6b1e50b2-8083-54c4-aa88-8458232b692e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.265.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.265.030","content_hash":"fb5344b78f99cc1d4c37fff460b8ab29d28ae4fa6b620ca94c190e48325fdc23","heading":null,"ordinal":9,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:9","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.265.030","text":"(c) Maximum Tower Height.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"b278f893-471d-5e42-8ed7-f28c0eb87ab4"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.265.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.265.030","content_hash":"70c42c9b55f888d0aea0f978d0151cd8449f41ae3030c07f7f8dbb07eb700d84","heading":null,"ordinal":10,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.265.030:block:10","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.265.030","text":"(1) Maximum tower height shall be as follows:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"369b612f-c20a-5334-b082-b9efa3a56353"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"table"},"citation":"18.265.030","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.265.030","content_hash":"3e4944ff090c1c94faa01b988c87023174f926b2b0947d5e08ed7d83f49f970f","heading":null,"ordinal":11,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:ci